ory\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 33 of them, same as January to February. In 2025, October to November finished at 75% and November to December at 73% on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 66% and April to May at 73%. Grid 19691 had its driest year in 2007 at 63%.</p>"}
